        <mxCell id="7jwuDECKpDgqieylm1P--182" value="&lt;b&gt;Language &lt;/b&gt;is founded on reinforcement learning through positive and negative feedback, where we find patterns in our sensory or analogous experiences and associate labels with them" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
