        <mxCell id="hU9yVLdhYgLbUcQZa_KH-4" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;We exist.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 4px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;If sensations occur, and &quot;not existing&quot;&lt;br&gt;necessarily requires sensations to&lt;br&gt;never occur, then we must exist.&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;size=30;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
